@	
s	dump	Dump one or more boilerplates to STDOUT
s	search	Search for boilerplates
s	root	Show the directory where gibo stores its boilerplates
s	help	Show help information
s	list	Show the list of available boilerplates
s	update	Update the list of available boilerplates
s	version	Show the current version of gibo installed
o	--help|-h	Show help for gibo	
@	dump
a	1	1
#	dump	1
g	gibo list	\n
@	search
a	1	0
@	root
@	help
@	list
@	update
@	version
